ent="true"><section class="sf10-static-text text"><section class="rich-text-editor"><p>Coinbase allows eligible customers to send wrapped versions of certain cryptocurrencies to wallet addresses on supported blockchains, enabling customers to transact on multiple networks while maintaining a single, unified balance of the native tokens in their Coinbase accounts. Each wrapped asset is backed 1:1 by its original cryptocurrency.</p><p>When transferring certain tokens via alternative networks, the sent funds may be converted into wrapped tokens. Always confirm the recipient supports the network you’re using before starting the transfer.</p><h2>Supported assets and networks</h2><table><tbody><tr><th><p><b>Assets</b></p></th><th><p><b>Networks</b></p></th></tr><tr><td><p>Coinbase Wrapped Bitcoin (cbBTC)</p><p>• Represents Bitcoin (BTC)</p></td><td><p>Base, Ethereum, Solana, Arbitrum</p></td></tr><tr><td><p>Coinbase Wrapped Dogecoin (cbDOGE)</p><p>• Represents Dogecoin (DOGE)</p></td><td><p>Base</p></td></tr><tr><td><p>Coinbase Wrapped Ripple (cbXRP) </p><p>• Represents Ripple (XRP)</p></td><td><p>Base</p></td></tr><tr><td><p>Coinbase Wrapped Cardano (cbADA)</p><p>• Represents Cardano (ADA)</p></td><td><p>Base</p></td></tr><tr><td><p>Coinbase Wrapped Litecoin (cbLTC)</p><p>• Represents Litecoin (LTC)</p></td><td><p>Base</p></td></tr><tr><td><p>Coinbase Wrapped MEGA (cbMEGA)</p><p>• Represents MegaETH (MEGA)</p></td><td><p>Base</p></td></tr><tr><td><p>Coinbase Wrapped Hyperliquid (cbHYPE)</p><p>• <!-- -->Represents Hyperliquid (HYPE)</p></td><td><p>Base</p></td></tr><tr><td><p>Coinbase Wrapped Zcash (cbZEC)</p><p>• <!-- -->Represents Zcash (ZEC)</p></td><td><p>Base</p></td></tr></tbody></table><h2>Send wrapped assets</h2><p>To send a Coinbase wrapped asset:</p><ol><li><p>Sign in to your Coinbase account.</p></li><li><p>Select <b>Transfer</b>, then <b>Send crypto</b>.</p></li><li><p>Enter the recipient&#x27;s address.</p></li><li><p>Choose the cryptocurrency you want to send (BTC for cbBTC, DOGE for cbDOGE, XRP for cbXRP, ADA for cbADA, LTC for cbLTC, MEGA for cbMEGA<u>,</u> HYPE for cbHYPE, or ZEC for cbZEC<!-- -->).</p></li><li><p>Select the desired network.</p></li><li><p>Enter the amount you want to send.</p></li><li><p>Review the transaction details, then select <b>Send now</b>. </p></li></ol><h2>Receive wrapped assets</h2><p>To receive a Coinbase wrapped asset:</p><ol><li><p>Sign in to your Coinbase account.</p></li><li><p>Select <b>Transfer</b>, then <b>Receive crypto.</b></p></li><li><p>Choose the cryptocurrency you want to receive (BTC for cbBTC, DOGE for cbDOGE, XRP for cbXRP, ADA for cbADA, LTC for cbLTC, MEGA for cbMEGA<u>,</u> HYPE for cbHYPE, or ZEC for cbZEC<!-- -->).</p></li><li><p>Select the appropriate network.</p></li><li><p>Share your address by copying it, or allow the sender to scan your QR code.</p></li></ol><p>Note: When you receive a Coinbase wrapped asset, Coinbase automatically unwraps it and credits your account with the underlying asset. For example, sending cbBTC to your Coinbase account will increase your BTC balance.</p><h2><b>Restrictions</b></h2><ul><li><p><b>cbBTC is currently unavailable to send from or receive to your Coinbase account in the following regions:</b></p><ul><li><p>Canada, Japan, Georgia</p></li></ul></li><li><p><b>cbDOGE, cbXRP, cbADA, cbLTC, and cbMEGA are currently unavailable to send from or receive to your Coinbase account in the following regions:</b></p><ul><li><p>Albania, Algeria, Angola, Argentina, Armenia, Austria, Bahrain, Bangladesh, Barbados, Belgium, Benin, Bermuda, Bolivia, British Virgin Islands, Bulgaria, Burkina Faso, Cambodia, Cameroon, Canada, Cayman Islands, Chile, Colombia, Costa Rica, Côte d&#x27;Ivoire, Croatia, Cyprus, Czech Republic, Denmark, Dominican Republic, Ecuador, Egypt, El Salvador, Estonia, Ethiopia, Faroe Islands, Finland, France, Gabon, Georgia, Germany, Ghana, Greece, Guatemala, Honduras, Hong Kong, Hungary, Iceland, Indonesia, Ireland, Israel, Italy, Jamaica, Japan, Kazakhstan, Kenya, Kuwait, Kyrgyzstan, Latvia, Liechtenstein, Lithuania, Luxembourg, Malaysia, Maldives, Malta, Mexico, Moldova, Mongolia, Morocco, Mozambique, Nepal, Netherlands, New Zealand, New York state, Niger, Nigeria, North Macedonia, Norway, Panama, Paraguay, Pakistan, Peru, Philippines, Poland, Portugal, Republic of the Congo, Romania, Saint Lucia, Saudi Arabia, Senegal, Serbia, Singapore, Slovakia, Slovenia, South Africa, South Korea, Spain, Sri Lanka, Sweden, Taiwan, Thailand, Togo, Trinidad and Tobago, Tunisia, Turkey, Ukraine, United Arab Emirates, Vietnam</p></li></ul></li><li><p><b>cbHYPE and cbZEC are currently unavailable to send from or receive to your Coinbase account in the following regions:</b></p><ul><li><p>Albania, Algeria, Angola, Argentina, Armenia, Austrailia, Austria, Bahrain, Bangladesh, Barbados, Belgium, Benin, Bermuda, Bolivia, Brazil, British Virgin Islands, Bulgaria, Burkina Faso, Cambodia, Cameroon, Canada, Cayman Islands, Chile, Colombia, Costa Rica, Côte d&#x27;Ivoire, Croatia, Cyprus, Czech Republic, Denmark, Dominican Republic, Ecuador, Egypt, El Salvador, Estonia, Ethiopia, Faroe Islands, Finland, France, Gabon, Georgia, Germany, Ghana, Greece, Guatemala, Honduras, Hong Kong, Hungary, Iceland, India, Indonesia, Ireland, Israel, Italy, Jamaica, Japan, Kazakhstan, Kenya, Kuwait, Kyrgyzstan, Latvia, Liechtenstein, Lithuania, Luxembourg, Malaysia, Maldives, Malta, Mexico, Moldova, Mongolia, Morocco, Mozambique, Nepal, Netherlands, New Zealand, New York state, Niger, Nigeria, North Macedonia, Norway, Panama, Paraguay, Pakistan, Peru, Philippines, Poland, Portugal, Republic of the Congo, Romania, Saint Lucia, Saudi Arabia, Senegal, Serbia, Singapore, Slovakia, Slovenia, South Africa, South Korea, Spain, Sri Lanka, Sweden, Taiwan, Thailand, Togo, Trinidad and Tobago, Tunisia, Turkey, Ukraine, United Arab Emirates, Vietnam</p></li></ul></li></ul><p>All third-party trademarks referenced are the property of their res